config LONG_ICM45686
	bool "Long ICM45686 IMU with integrated VQF orientation filter"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_LONG_ICM45686_ENABLED && I2C
	help
	  ICM45686 6-axis IMU driver with integrated VQF (Versatile Quaternion
	  Filter) sensor fusion. Uses the sensor's internal 32kHz RC oscillator
	  — no external crystal required. Outputs orientation (roll/pitch/yaw
	  in degrees) and debiased angular velocity (rad/s) via the Zephyr
	  sensor API.

	  ODR is 100 Hz, suitable for M0+/M4 MCUs without FPU.
	  VQF runs in single-precision (float) mode.
